  "statuteText": "265-A:29 Revocation of Nonresident Privilege. –\n\nWhen it has been finally determined under the procedures of this subdivision that a nonresident's privilege to drive a motor vehicle in this state has been revoked, the department shall give information in writing or by electronic means of the action taken to the motor vehicle administrator of the state of the person's residence and of any state in which he or she has a license."
